  "@id": "https://pices-data.github.io/odis/records/zenodo-23568491.jsonld",
  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Strait of Georgia CTD and Bottle Data by STRATOGEM",
  "description": "CTD data collected in the Strait of Georgia by STRATOGEM. 9 stations occupied in CW direction around southern Strait of Georgia at varying depths. At each station probe is cast to near-bottom with Temp/Sal/O 2 /Chl Fluorescence/PAR/Transmissivity/OPC data gathered at 4Hz from SBE25. Bottle data are sampled from CTD wire at various depths. All bottles are analyzed for sal/O 2 /NO 3 /PO 4 /Si. Monthly sample collection began11 April, 2002.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To define the effects of tidal, diurnal, weatherband, seasonal, and climatic influences in the production surface layer of Strait of Georgia.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23568492",
